    "narration": {
      "1": "Traffic enters through the cloud load balancer.",
      "2": "The ingress controller has its own namespace.",
      "3": "ingress-nginx routes hosts and paths to services.",
      "4": "The shop namespace holds the stateless deployments.",
      "5": "frontend: the web app, three replicas.",
      "6": "api: the backend, autoscaled between 3 and 12 pods.",
      "7": "worker: background jobs pulled from Kafka.",
      "8": "The data namespace holds the stateful sets.",
      "9": "postgres-0: a StatefulSet with a 100 GB volume.",
      "10": "redis-0: cache and rate-limit counters.",
      "11": "kafka-0: the job and event stream.",
      "12": "Monitoring watches all of it.",
      "13": "Prometheus scrapes every pod and node.",
      "14": "Alertmanager pages the on-call engineer.",
      "15": "The nodes the pods are scheduled on.",
      "16": "Underneath, three worker nodes…",
      "17": "…each running a mix of pods…",
      "18": "…so losing one node costs capacity, not the service."
